    category: "novenas",
    day: 7,
    intention: "For holy and faithful priests",
    text: `O holy Padre Pio, you who loved the Holy Sacrifice of the Mass with such intensity that you often celebrated for hours, immersed in the divine mysteries, intercede today for all priests throughout the world. Obtain for them the grace of profound devotion to the Holy Eucharist, that they may celebrate Mass with reverence, awe, and love. Saint Pio, protect priests from the snares of the devil, from discouragement, and from the temptations of the world. Strengthen those who are faithful and convert those who have grown lukewarm. Inspire in the hearts of young men the desire to offer their lives in the sacred priesthood, that the Church may never lack holy ministers to offer the sacrifice of the altar and bring Christ to the world through the Sacraments. Amen.`
