    text: `O Padre Pio, wonder worker of the modern age, you who healed the sick by the hundreds through the power of God, I come to you today seeking healing. Whether the illness be of body, mind, or soul, I place my hope in your powerful intercession before the throne of God. You who experienced suffering in your own body yet brought healing to others, understand the pain and desperation of the sick. Saint Pio, obtain for me the grace of healing according to God's holy will. If complete healing is not God's plan, grant me the grace to bear my illness with patience and to offer it as a participation in the sufferings of Christ for the salvation of souls. May God's healing power work through your intercession to restore me to health and to strengthen my faith. Amen.`
