    intention: "For miraculous graces and the triumph of faith",
    text: `O glorious Padre Pio, whose life was a continuous miracle and whose intercession continues to work wonders in our day, I come to you at the conclusion of this novena with a heart full of faith and hope. You who raised the dead, healed the incurable, and confounded the laws of nature by the power of God, intercede for me in all my needs. Saint Pio, I trust that your intercession will obtain for me the graces I need for my salvation and sanctification. Whether the miracle I seek is granted or whether God has something better in store for me, I accept His will with confidence and gratitude. Obtain for me the grace to believe always, to hope against hope, and to love God above all things. O Padre Pio, pray for us that we may become worthy of the promises of Christ. Amen.`
